    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Lean `BybitCryptoFuturesRegressionAlgorithm.py`。经纪 `BYBIT` MARGIN；另加现货 BTCUSDT；`add_crypto_future(\"BTCUSDT\")`/`(\"BTCUSD\")` 分钟；`fast=ema(BTCUSDT永续,30)`，`slow=ema(...,60)`。快>慢且空仓且订单数=0：`buy(BTCUSD,1000)` 预期拒单后 `buy(BTCUSD,100)` 与 `buy(BTCUSDT,0.01)`；`elif` 订单数=3：`sell(BTCUSD,300)`、`sell(BTCUSDT,0.03)`。不是币安永续核（W478/W490）。提出日期未知。Bybit 永续+现货双合约 BTCUSDT/BTCUSD EMA30/60 ≠ 币安永续（W478/W490）。计入加密。提出日期按源文件原样保留未知。"
